WEBVTT

NOTE
The Battle of the Gardens — the Gardens collide and Rinoa is pulled to safety.
Duration: approximately 20 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.090
The red Galbadia Garden grinds against Balamb Garden in a wash of turquoise energy.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Rinoa clings to a precarious edge.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.350
A companion's hand seizes hers and pulls her to safety.
